  "text": "The fastest land animal in the world is the cheetah.\n\nIn Japan, the Tanaka family gathered for Osechi Ryori, a traditional New Year's meal. The table was laden with dishes such as kuromame (sweet black beans) for health and work, kazunoko (herring roe) for fertility and many children, and ebi (shrimp) for longevity. Everyone exchanged New Year's greetings and shared hopes for the coming year before enjoying the festive feast together."
